      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMPORTANT: I found that ppi-\u003eb_calculate_psnr is initialized to 1 when `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` is defined as 1:\n\n```\nAV1_PRIMARY *av1_create_primary_compressor(\n    struct aom_codec_pkt_list *pkt_list_head, int num_lap_buffers,\n    const AV1EncoderConfig *oxcf) {\n  ...\n  ppi-\u003eb_calculate_psnr \u003d CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS;\n```\n\nSo we need to preserve the original if statement so that we don\u0027t overwrite the initial value of 1:\n\n```\n    if ((ctx-\u003ebase.init_flags \u0026 AOM_CODEC_USE_PSNR) ||\n        (flags \u0026 AOM_EFLAG_CALCULATE_PSNR)) {\n      ppi-\u003eb_calculate_psnr \u003d 1;\n    }  \n```",
      "revId": "5a79200c31b8f9cbe665a014ff0801e722f08d58",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f8838a50_029c0b0c",
        "filename": "av1/av1_cx_iface.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 3280,
