      "side": 1,
      "message": "Philipp: I am afraid that I don\u0027t quite understand what you meant by \"changing that\" in your suggestion \"So changing that should be safe and maybe even reduces test time.\"\n\nThe build option `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` is defined in \nbuild/cmake/aom_config_defaults.cmake as follows:\n\n```\nset_aom_config_var(CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS 0 \"Enables internal encoder stats.\")\n```\n\nIts default value is 0 (OFF). You wrote:\n\n\u003e in the \"usual\" test configuration which defines CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS\n\nWhy do you think `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` is set to 1 in the usual test configuration?\n\nTo properly handle the builds that set `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` to 1, we can modify your tests to check `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` at the appropriate places.\n\nOr were you suggesting the following change?\n\n```\ndiff --git a/av1/encoder/encoder.c b/av1/encoder/encoder.c\nindex 59ac427c2d..33fadd41c0 100644\n--- a/av1/encoder/encoder.c\n+++ b/av1/encoder/encoder.c\n@@ -1129,7 +1129,7 @@ AV1_PRIMARY *av1_create_primary_compressor(\n   ppi-\u003eseq_params_locked \u003d 0;\n   ppi-\u003elap_enabled \u003d num_lap_buffers \u003e 0;\n   ppi-\u003eoutput_pkt_list \u003d pkt_list_head;\n-  ppi-\u003eb_calculate_psnr \u003d CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS;\n+  ppi-\u003eb_calculate_psnr \u003d 0;\n   ppi-\u003eframes_left \u003d oxcf-\u003einput_cfg.limit;\n   ppi-\u003enum_fp_contexts \u003d 1;\n \n```",
      "parentUuid": "33c9acbc_9f9eac60",
      "revId": "5a79200c31b8f9cbe665a014ff0801e722f08d58",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
